  title="Record a product demo video on your Mac"
  lede="A good product demo is short, zoomed in on what matters, captioned, and easy to send. Reelbird gets you a link the moment you stop, then lets you add the zooms, captions and blurs and update the same link. It's free and open source. Here's a workflow that works for launches, sales follow-ups and help docs."
  crumbs={[{ name: "Use cases", path: "/use-cases/" }, { name: "Product demos", path }]}
  datePublished="2026-11-07"
